  a epo:Procedure;
  epo:foreseesContractSpecificTerm <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/26d35a19-fdd4-4418-94b9-d1a3dfe7704e-01/ProcurementProjectContractTerm$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProject1>,
    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/26d35a19-fdd4-4418-94b9-d1a3dfe7704e-01/ProcurementProjectContractTerm$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProject1_RealizedLocation1>;
  epo:hasLaunchFrameworkAgreementMaximumValue <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/26d35a19-fdd4-4418-94b9-d1a3dfe7704e-01/ProcedureValueEstimateExtension$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProject1_RequestedTenderTotal1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1>;
  epo:hasLegalBasis <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/legal-basis/32014L0024>;
  epo:hasMainFeature """Lot 1 Development and Delivery of Unit 1
Personal Leadership Development Unit – this unit aims to develop the individual leadership potentials of each participant. There is no request for tenderers to provide the physical facilities to deliver the Unit.
Lot 2 Development and Delivery of Unit Advanced Leadership Development Unit 
This unit aims to develop insights into cutting edge leadership understandings and insights into their practical applications in the participants’ professional roles. There is a residential element to this unit, and thus this Lot includes a request for the provision of full-service residential facilities for the delivery of the residential element of this Unit. However, tenderers may request, without prejudice, to tender only for the development and delivery elements, without providing the physical facilities to deliver the Unit.
Lot 3 Cross-Boundary Leadership Development Unit 
This unit aims to develop the participants’ leadership capacity in the specific professional arena, fostering leadership effectiveness across organisational and sectoral boundaries. There is no request for tenderers to provide the physical facilities to deliver the Unit.
"""@en;
