  dct:description "The provision of Strategic Leadership Programmes for Senior Public Service Grade and Principal Officer / Public Service Directors Equivalent Grades across the Public Service across three lots: Lot 1 Personal Leadership Development Unit Lot 2 Advanced Leadership Development Unit Lot 3 Cross-Boundary Leadership Development Unit All tenders must be submitted via ZIP file"@en;
